### Reviewed component details
ChatInput is an advanced, accessible chat interface component built with the Tiptap rich-text editor engine and Tailwind CSS. It is tailored for modern conversational AI interfaces, featuring an expandable multi-line text editor with placeholder support, interactive @ mention suggestion autocompletion (with configurable trigger, mention item lists, and keyboard navigation), and real-time streaming status management. The input is modularly constructed using InputGroup primitives, supporting flexible addon slots for mention buttons, clear controls, and submit action triggers. Direct dependencies include @tiptap/core, @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/extension-mention, @tiptap/extension-placeholder, @tiptap/suggestion, the Vercel AI SDK ('ai') for ChatStatus types, and lucide-react for UI iconography. For installation, add chat-input.tsx to your components directory, ensure Tiptap extensions and peer dependencies are installed, and wrap the component inside your chat interface form with onSubmit and status bindings.

